/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!method(object, name)` construct.
 *
 * The pragma accesses at compile time the method of an object named by a
 * string, as `object.name` does, or as `object:.name` does when the object is
 * written `alias object`. It never reads a field, which `__pragma!field` does.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::method_value
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/method_value.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-11-17
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
